# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "As mentioned before, once a program is `RUNNING`, you can use `job.logs()` to fetch logs created from `print()` outputs:\n"
msgstr "Jak wspomniano wcześniej, gdy program ma status `RUNNING`, możesz użyć `job.logs()`, aby pobrać logi utworzone z wyjść `print()`:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "At any time, you can also cancel a job:\n"
msgstr "W dowolnym momencie możesz również anulować zadanie:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Once a program is `DONE`, you can use `job.results()` to fetch the result stored in `save_result()`:\n"
msgstr "Gdy program ma status `DONE`, możesz użyć `job.results()`, aby pobrać wynik zapisany w `save_result()`:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
