msgid "List jobs previously run with Qiskit Serverless {#list-jobs-previously-run-with-qiskit-serverless}"
msgstr "Wyświetlanie listy wcześniej uruchomionych zadań z Qiskit Serverless {#list-jobs-previously-run-with-qiskit-serverless}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
